OL,3,CInfantino broke trust 'through
OL,4,Cdeception', say three football
OL,5,Cfederations
OL,7,FFootball federations for Europe, Asia
OL,8,Fand North America have issued a joint
OL,9,Fopen letter suggesting Fifa president
OL,10,FGianni Infantino broke trust "through
OL,11,Fdeception" over his World Cup sell-off
OL,12,Fplan.
OL,14,FThe letter, signed by presidents and
OL,15,Fgeneral secretaries of Uefa, Concacaf
OL,16,Fand the Asian Football Confederation,
OL,17,Faccuses the head of world football's
OL,18,Fgoverning body of a "failure of
OL,19,Fjudgement".
OL,26,@rD@^OUsD@JO]zD@UOU{D@JO]
