OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1786650498
OL,3,CInfantino broke trust 'through
OL,4,Cdeception', say three football
OL,5,Cfederations
OL,7,FThe move the latest push to pressure
OL,8,FInfantino into resigning.
OL,10,FHe has faced criticism following his
OL,11,Ffailed plan to seek private investment
OL,12,Fin a company which would run Fifa's
OL,13,Fcompetitions and sell stakes in the
OL,14,FWorld Cup to private investors.
OL,16,FFifa then revealed it "will not
OL,17,Fproceed" with the idea and Infantino
OL,18,Fon Wednesday apologised to national
OL,19,Fassociations over how the plan was
OL,20,Fdeveloped.
OL,26,@xD@WOUyD@HO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,312,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1786650498
OL,3,CInfantino broke trust 'through
OL,4,Cdeception', say three football
OL,5,Cfederations
OL,7,FThe letter said: "Leadership in
OL,8,Ffootball is not a possession. It is
OL,9,Fnot about holding - or demanding -
OL,10,Fpower to be held.
OL,12,F"It is a duty of service to the
OL,13,Ffootball family that entrusts it.
OL,15,F"When trust is broken through
OL,16,Fdeception, when an individual places
OL,17,Fhimself above the collective that
OL,18,Fentrusted him with authority, that
OL,19,Fduty has been abandoned."
OL,26,@oD@ROUtD@AOUwD@AOU{D@YO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/8
