OL,3,CInfantino broke trust 'through
OL,4,Cdeception', say three football
OL,5,Cfederations
OL,7,FThe authors also call for a review to
OL,8,Fbe conducted by a "fully independent
OL,9,Fthird party" after Fifa committed to
OL,10,Fpresent a report to the Fifa Council
OL,11,Fin October.
OL,13,FAssociations such as Uefa and the
OL,14,FFootball Association have called for
OL,15,FInfantino to resign.
