OL,3,CInfantino broke trust 'through
OL,4,Cdeception', say three football
OL,5,Cfederations
OL,7,FThe pressure notched higher this week
OL,8,Fwhen Uefa confirmed a "departure
OL,9,Fpayment" was made to a female employee
OL,10,Fwho is alleged to have been in a
OL,11,Frelationship with Infantino while he
OL,12,Fwas general secretary of the
OL,13,Forganisation. Infantino denied the
OL,14,Fclaims first published by the Daily
OL,15,FTelegraph.
OL,26,@pD@WOUqD@HO]
