OL,3,CInfantino broke trust 'through
OL,4,Cdeception', say three football
OL,5,Cfederations
OL,7,FFifa hit out at Infantino's critics
OL,8,Fand accused them of trying weaken his
OL,9,Fauthority so he is removed from his
OL,10,Frole without a due re-election
OL,11,Fprocess, while the Mexico and
OL,12,FArgentina associations have come out
OL,13,Fin support of him.
OL,15,FA European threat to boycott the World
OL,16,FCup remains in place despite
OL,17,FInfantino's apology.
OL,19,FOn Sunday, LaLiga president Javier
OL,20,FTebas claimed Infantino is "destroying
OL,21,Fthe very essence" of football.
OL,26,@|D@\OU}D@QO]
