OL,3,CInfantino broke trust 'through
OL,4,Cdeception', say three football
OL,5,Cfederations
OL,7,FSpeaking to Le Monde, he said: "For
OL,8,Fme, Gianni Infantino's time has long
OL,9,Fsince passed.
OL,11,F"I'm not saying this because of recent
OL,12,Fevents; I have noticed this style of
OL,13,Fmanagement for a long time, though
OL,14,Feveryone else seems to be discovering
OL,15,Fit only now.
OL,17,F"Gianni Infantino is not someone who
OL,18,Fcontributes to the growth of football.
OL,19,FOn the contrary, his projects are
OL,20,Fdestroying the very essence of the
OL,21,Fsport: the national leagues.
OL,26,@oD@`OUsD@AOUyD@AOU
