OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1786650498
OL,3,CInfantino broke trust 'through
OL,4,Cdeception', say three football
OL,5,Cfederations
OL,7,F"Football is not limited to the elite.
OL,8,FFor me, the Infantino era is over.
OL,10,F"What remains to be seen is when that
OL,11,Fwill take effect and how the
OL,12,Fsuccession will unfold. I hope it is
OL,13,Fnot just a matter of swapping out some
OL,14,Fpeople for others, but of a genuine
OL,15,Foverhaul."
